			"notes": "## Beds, but Endgame 0.4.0\n\nThis is the finished singleplayer release for Minecraft 26.2.\n\n### Changes\n\n- Finalized the Bedside Table variants for every vanilla wood type.\n- Updated the Bedside Table model with corrected UVs and lighting adjustments.\n- Confirmed the correct preferred tools and drops for every variant.\n- Confirmed vanilla fire behavior for every variant.\n- Crimson and Warped Bedside Tables correctly remain nonflammable.\n- Confirmed the Bedside Table sleep requirement and respawn behavior in singleplayer.\n\n### Known issue\n\n- Some parts of the Bedside Table can render unusually dark when an opaque full block is placed directly beside it. This is a visual-only issue and does not affect block behavior.\n\n### Testing status\n\n- Singleplayer: Tested\n- Dedicated multiplayer: Not tested"
		},
