			"notes": "## Beds, but Endgame 0.2.0\n\nThe first public release of Beds, but Endgame.\n\n### Features\n\n- Adds the Bedside Table\n- Sleeping requires a Bedside Table beside the head of the bed\n- Respawn points can still be set without a valid table\n- Adds optional nightmares with a 35% chance\n- A Soul Lantern on a valid Bedside Table prevents nightmares\n- Adds optional natural insomnia phantom suppression\n- Adds shared configuration through Mod Menu and `/bbe` commands\n- Keeps vanilla Nether and End bed behavior\n\n### Default settings\n\n- Nightmares: On\n- Disable insomnia phantoms: On\n\n### Commands\n\n```text\n/bbe config\n/bbe config nightmares <on|off>\n/bbe config disablePhantoms <on|off>"
